Output: Urban Transport subprojects successfully implemented 
Indicator: 2 - lane road over bridges (ROB) constructed in 4 ULBs 
Progress/Status: 5 ROBs have been constructed in Alwar, Baran, Barmer, Churu, and Sawai Madhopur; and 5 road works completed in Sikar, Baran and Bundi. 
